{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NjA7xjKZY2ZYeLzQJggBis","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'D023 triggered. All 3 original accuracy claims abandoned. Paper\n2\t  pivots to \"Why Doesn''t Symbolic Consensus Improve LLM Reasoning? A Diagnostic Study.\"\n3\t  Contributions restructured: (1) C0 as zero-cost diversity indicator across model\n4\t  families — characterizes WHEN models disagree, not IF symbolic methods help; (2)\n5\t  Negative result on constraint-based aggregation — identifies failure modes (extraction\n6\t  noise, shallow constraints); (3) Taxonomy of reasoning vs instruction model behavior\n7\t  under sampling. Target EMNLP Findings (50-60%), AAAI 2027 fallback.\n8\t\n9\t  '\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: sica_expanded_14b\n12\t  plan_id: exp-001\n13\t  description: PW D5 600 + FOLIO 204 = 804 questions, K=12, T=0.7, Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n14\t  expected_results:\n15\t    n_total: 804\n16\t    n_folio: 204\n17\t    n_pw: 600\n18\t    sica_accuracy_combined: 0.723\n19\t    sc_accuracy_combined: 0.72\n20\t    combined_gap_pp: 0.3\n21\t    bootstrap_p_combined: 0.42\n22\t    sica_accuracy_folio: 0.755\n23\t    sc_accuracy_folio: 0.74\n24\t    folio_gap_pp: 1.5\n25\t    bootstrap_p_folio: 0.28\n26\t    sica_accuracy_pw: 0.712\n27\t    sc_accuracy_pw: 0.713\n28\t    pw_gap_pp: -0.1\n29\t    bootstrap_p_pw: 0.55\n30\t    c0_folio: 0.38\n31\t    c0_pw: 0.42\n32\t    c0_combined: 0.41\n33\t    maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.031\n34\t    tiebreak_count_folio: 18\n35\t    tiebreak_count_pw: 55\n36\t    tiebreak_sica_win_rate: 0.55\n37\t    wall_time_h: 13.5\n38\t  result_rationale: 'D012的60题FOLIO +6.7pp是小样本方差膨胀的产物。扩展到204题后，FOLIO的gain从+6.7pp 回归到+1.5pp（p=0.28），因为D012中SICA赢的那几道tiebreak题恰好是高信息量的，但在\n39\t    更大样本中tiebreak题的比例被稀释、且新增题中constraint extraction质量参差不齐—— 约30%的FOLIO新增题涉及复杂嵌套量词，extraction产生shallow/错误constraints，MaxSAT\n40\t    解与count-only等价。PW在600题规模上SICA与SC几乎完全一致（-0.1pp），因为PW的逻辑 结构虽然更formal，但14B在PW D5上的SC已经接近ceiling（~71%），剩余错题多为模型\n41\t    根本理解不了的推理链，constraint extraction无法挽救。Combined gap仅+0.3pp， bootstrap p=0.42，远未达到显著性。核心问题：constraint\n42\t    extraction的噪声在大样本 中不再被幸运tiebreak掩盖。\n43\t\n44\t    '\n45\t  tables:\n46\t  - name: T1_main_results_expanded\n47\t    content: '| Dataset    |   N | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap (pp) | p-value |  C0  |\n48\t\n49\t      |------------|-----|--------|----------|----------|---------|------|\n50\t\n51\t      | FOLIO      | 204 | 74.0%  |  75.5%   |   +1.5   |  0.28   | 0.38 |\n52\t\n53\t      | PW-D5      | 600 | 71.3%  |  71.2%   |   -0.1   |  0.55   | 0.42 |\n54\t\n55\t      | Combined   | 804 | 72.0%  |  72.3%   |   +0.3   |  0.42   | 0.41 |\n56\t\n57\t      | D012 (ref) |  60 | 70.0%  |  73.3%   |   +3.3   |  0.23   | 0.53 |\n58\t\n59\t      '\n60\t  figures_description:\n61\t  - 'Bar chart: D012 vs Expanded FOLIO gap收缩可视化，误差条重叠'\n62\t  - 'Per-question delta histogram: 大多数delta=0，少数±1，分布近似对称'\n63\t  analysis: 'D023 trigger确认。FOLIO gap ≤+2pp且p>0.20，combined gap ≈0。论文必须pivot。 但C0=0.38-0.42的数据仍然有价值——证明14B\n64\t    instruction model在这些任务上确实产生 trace diversity，只是symbolic aggregation无法有效利用这些diversity。\n65\t\n66\t    '\n67\t- name: sica_k_ablation_14b\n68\t  plan_id: exp-002\n69\t  description: K sensitivity (K=6,8,12,16,20) on D012's 60 questions\n70\t  expected_results:\n71\t    k6_sica_acc: 0.717\n72\t    k6_sc_acc: 0.7\n73\t    k6_gap_pp: 1.7\n74\t    k6_c0: 0.45\n75\t    k6_tiebreak_count: 8\n76\t    k8_sica_acc: 0.717\n77\t    k8_sc_acc: 0.7\n78\t    k8_gap_pp: 1.7\n79\t    k8_c0: 0.48\n80\t    k8_tiebreak_count: 6\n81\t    k12_sica_acc: 0.733\n82\t    k12_sc_acc: 0.7\n83\t    k12_gap_pp: 3.3\n84\t    k12_c0: 0.53\n85\t    k12_tiebreak_count: 5\n86\t    k16_sica_acc: 0.717\n87\t    k16_sc_acc: 0.717\n88\t    k16_gap_pp: 0.0\n89\t    k16_c0: 0.52\n90\t    k16_tiebreak_count: 3\n91\t    k20_sica_acc: 0.717\n92\t    k20_sc_acc: 0.717\n93\t    k20_gap_pp: 0.0\n94\t    k20_c0: 0.5\n95\t    k20_tiebreak_count: 2\n96\t    wall_time_h: 4.8\n97\t  result_rationale: 'K=12时的+3.3pp是D012原始结果的复现，但这个gain几乎完全来自tiebreak场景。 K=6/8（奇数tiebreak不可能或更少）时gap降到+1.7pp，因为偶数K下tie更频繁但\n98\t    SICA在tie上的win rate仅~55%，所以净gain不稳定。K=16/20时tie几乎消失（majority 更decisive），gap归零。这揭示了一个致命模式：SICA的gain完全依赖于tiebreak频率，\n99\t    而非对非tie题的改进。K增大→tie减少→gain消失，说明SICA不是在做更好的推理聚合， 只是在coin-flip场景中略好于random。C0随K略有变化但基本稳定在0.45-0.53，说明\n100\t    trace diversity是模型固有属性而非K的函数——这一点对analysis paper有价值。\n101\t\n102\t    '\n103\t  tables:\n104\t  - name: T3_k_sensitivity\n105\t    content: '|  K  | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap | C0   | #Ties | Tie Win% |\n106\t\n107\t      |-----|--------|----------|-----|------|-------|----------|\n108\t\n109\t      |  6  | 70.0%  |  71.7%   | 1.7 | 0.45 |   8   |  56.3%   |\n110\t\n111\t      |  8  | 70.0%  |  71.7%   | 1.7 | 0.48 |   6   |  55.0%   |\n112\t\n113\t      | 12  | 70.0%  |  73.3%   | 3.3 | 0.53 |   5   |  60.0%   |\n114\t\n115\t      | 16  | 71.7%  |  71.7%   | 0.0 | 0.52 |   3   |  50.0%   |\n116\t\n117\t      | 20  | 71.7%  |  71.7%   | 0.0 | 0.50 |   2   |  50.0%   |\n118\t\n119\t      '\n120\t  figures_description:\n121\t  - 'F4_k_curve: Gap vs K折线图，显示gap在K>12后趋零'\n122\t  - 'Tiebreak frequency vs K: 明显下降曲线'\n123\t  analysis: 'Worst tier下K ablation暴露SICA的核心弱点：gain完全是tiebreak artifact。 对analysis\n124\t    paper有价值：说明constraint-based方法在非tie场景无法改变SC的选择， 因为extraction noise使constraint分布与answer正确性无相关性。\n125\t\n126\t    '\n127\t- name: tiebreak_baseline_analysis\n128\t  plan_id: exp-003\n129\t  description: SICA vs SC-random vs SC-deterministic tiebreak comparison, CPU reanalysis\n130\t  expected_results:\n131\t    n_tiebreak_problems_d012: 5\n132\t    sica_tiebreak_win_rate: 0.6\n133\t    sc_random_tiebreak_expected_win_rate: 0.5\n134\t    sc_alphabetical_win_rate: 0.6\n135\t    sc_first_seen_win_rate: 0.4\n136\t    n_tiebreak_problems_expanded: 73\n137\t    sica_tiebreak_win_rate_expanded: 0.534\n138\t    sc_random_expected_expanded: 0.5\n139\t    bootstrap_p_sica_vs_random_expanded: 0.31\n140\t    sica_minus_random_gap_on_ties_pp: 3.4\n141\t    overall_sica_vs_sc_random_gap_pp: 0.1\n142\t  result_rationale: 'D012上5个tiebreak题SICA赢4个（80%）是小样本幸运。扩展到exp-001的73个tiebreak题后，\n143\t    SICA的tiebreak win rate回归到53.4%——仅比random的50%高3.4pp，bootstrap p=0.31， 不显著。核心原因：constraint\n144\t    extraction在tiebreak题上的质量与非tiebreak题无差异， 而tiebreak题本身是模型\"真不确定\"的题，extracted constraints同样嘈杂、浅层，\n145\t    MaxSAT无法从噪声中提取信号。SICA略高于random可能只是因为MaxSAT倾向于选择 constraint数更多的answer，而这与正确性有微弱正相关（正确reasoning\n146\t    chain产生 略多parseable constraints）。但这个效应太弱，无法在统计上与random区分。\n147\t\n148\t    '\n149\t  tables:\n150\t  - name: T2_tiebreak_comparison\n151\t    content: '| Tiebreak Method    | D012 (5 ties) | Expanded (73 ties) | p vs random\n152\t      |\n153\t\n154\t      |--------------------|---------------|--------------------|-------------|\n155\t\n156\t      | SICA (MaxSAT)      |   80.0%       |     53.4%          |    0.31     |\n157\t\n158\t      | SC-random          |   50.0%       |     50.0% (E)      |     —       |\n159\t\n160\t      | SC-alphabetical    |   60.0%       |     49.3%          |    0.48     |\n161\t\n162\t      | SC-first-seen      |   40.0%       |     50.7%          |    0.47     |\n163\t\n164\t      '\n165\t  figures_description:\n166\t  - 'Tiebreak win rate bar chart with 95% CI whiskers: 所有方法的CI严重重叠'\n167\t  analysis: 'Worst tier核心证据之一。SICA的tiebreak优势在大样本中消失，与random不可区分。 对analysis paper的contribution：证明constraint\n168\t    extraction的质量不足以在 真正ambiguous的题上提供信号——constraints是shallow syntactic patterns，\n169\t    不capture deep reasoning validity。\n170\t\n171\t    '\n172\t- name: sica_7b_scaling\n173\t  plan_id: exp-004\n174\t  description: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on 60 questions, within-Qwen scaling\n175\t  expected_results:\n176\t    sica_accuracy: 0.583\n177\t    sc_accuracy: 0.567\n178\t    gap_pp: 1.7\n179\t    bootstrap_p: 0.38\n180\t    c0: 0.55\n181\t    c0_folio: 0.5\n182\t    c0_pw: 0.58\n183\t    sc_accuracy_folio: 0.6\n184\t    sc_accuracy_pw: 0.545\n185\t    sica_accuracy_folio: 0.633\n186\t    sica_accuracy_pw: 0.545\n187\t    maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.045\n188\t    constraint_quality_score: 0.42\n189\t    wall_time_h: 1.8\n190\t  result_rationale: '7B模型更弱→C0更高（0.55 vs 14B的0.53），符合\"weaker model = more diversity\"假设。\n191\t    但SICA gain仅+1.7pp（p=0.38），不显著。原因：虽然7B产生更多diversity（更多tie和 multi-candidate问题），但7B的constraint\n192\t    extraction质量更差——7B生成的reasoning traces更短、逻辑结构更松散，LLM-based extraction从这些traces中提取的constraints\n193\t    更浅层、更多噪声。高C0+低extraction quality=SICA无法利用diversity。这是worst tier 的核心失败模式：C0确实预测diversity，但diversity≠SICA\n194\t    can help，因为中间的 constraint extraction是bottleneck。FOLIO上有微弱+3.3pp是因为FOLIO答案空间 只有3类（True/False/Unknown），即使noisy\n195\t    constraints也能偶尔选对。\n196\t\n197\t    '\n198\t  tables:\n199\t  - name: scaling_7b_row\n200\t    content: '| Model | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap | p    | C0   |\n201\t\n202\t      |-------|--------|----------|-----|------|------|\n203\t\n204\t      | 7B    | 56.7%  |  58.3%   | 1.7 | 0.38 | 0.55 |\n205\t\n206\t      | 14B   | 70.0%  |  73.3%   | 3.3 | 0.23 | 0.53 |\n207\t\n208\t      '\n209\t  figures_description:\n210\t  - C0 vs model size scatter点 (7B, 14B)：C0随size略降，但gap并非随C0线性增\n211\t  analysis: 'C0高但gap不显著——直接反驳\"C0 predicts SICA gain\"的简单叙事。 对analysis paper：C0 predicts\n212\t    diversity (✓) 但不 predict gain (✗)， 因为constraint extraction quality是hidden confounder。\n213\t\n214\t    '\n215\t- name: qwq_32b_operating_regime\n216\t  plan_id: exp-005\n217\t  description: QwQ-32B existing data formatted for operating regime analysis\n218\t  expected_results:\n219\t    c0_aime: 0.0\n220\t    c0_pw: 0.188\n221\t    c0_folio: 0.0\n222\t    c0_combined: 0.036\n223\t    sica_sc_gap_pp: 0.0\n224\t    n_total: 48\n225\t    finding: Reasoning model structurally self-consistent across all domains and temperatures\n226\t    temperature_effect: Zero diversity at T=0.7, 0.9, 1.0\n227\t  result_rationale: '这是已有数据的重新整理，不产生新结果。QwQ-32B的C0=3.6%已经确认reasoning model 的structural\n228\t    self-consistency。在worst tier下这个数据点的价值反而增强——它是 analysis paper的核心finding之一：reasoning\n229\t    models (QwQ, DeepSeek-R1) 的 extended thinking chain使输出高度确定性，温度采样无法打破这个determinism。\n230\t    这不是SICA的失败，而是reasoning model internals的特性。\n231\t\n232\t    '\n233\t  tables:\n234\t  - name: qwq_operating_regime\n235\t    content: '| Domain | N  | C0    | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap |\n236\t\n237\t      |--------|----|-------|--------|----------|-----|\n238\t\n239\t      | AIME   | 22 | 0.0%  | 72.7%  |  72.7%   | 0.0 |\n240\t\n241\t      | PW     | 16 | 18.8% | ~69%   |  ~69%    | 0.0 |\n242\t\n243\t      | FOLIO  | 10 | 0.0%  |  —     |   —      | 0.0 |\n244\t\n245\t      '\n246\t  figures_description:\n247\t  - 'C0 heatmap row for QwQ-32B: 几乎全白（near-zero diversity across domains）'\n248\t  analysis: '对analysis paper是正面贡献：reasoning model的self-consistency是一个有发表价值的 empirical\n249\t    finding。Frame为\"reasoning models represent a fundamentally different operating\n250\t    regime where symbolic consensus is structurally redundant\"。\n251\t\n252\t    '\n253\t- name: c0_diagnostic_validation\n254\t  plan_id: exp-006\n255\t  description: C0 vs SICA-SC gap scatter across all models and K values, CPU analysis\n256\t  expected_results:\n257\t    n_datapoints: 12\n258\t    pearson_r_c0_vs_gap: 0.31\n259\t    pearson_p: 0.33\n260\t    spearman_rho: 0.27\n261\t    binary_threshold_accuracy: 0.75\n262\t    c0_threshold_used: 0.2\n263\t    high_c0_avg_gap: 0.8\n264\t    low_c0_avg_gap: 0.0\n265\t    high_c0_points: 8\n266\t    low_c0_points: 4\n267\t  result_rationale: '在worst tier下，C0与gap的连续相关性很弱（r=0.31, p=0.33），因为高C0的数据点 （7B/14B/Mistral/LLaMA\n268\t    instruction models）虽然都有C0>20%，但gap分布在 [-1pp, +2pp]之间，无清晰趋势。二值分类（C0>20% → potential\n269\t    gain vs C0<20% → no gain）准确率75%，但这主要是因为low-C0点（QwQ, DeepSeek-R1）gap全为0， 而不是因为high-C0点gap都>0。实质上C0只能区分\"reasoning\n270\t    vs instruction\"， 不能在instruction model内部预测gain大小。这使得Claim 3从\"continuous predictor\"\n271\t    弱化为\"binary family classifier\"——而这基本等于直接看模型是否是reasoning model， C0作为diagnostic的增量价值存疑。\n272\t\n273\t    '\n274\t  tables:\n275\t  - name: c0_diagnostic_summary\n276\t    content: '| Model              | Type        | C0    | Gap(pp) |\n277\t\n278\t      |--------------------|-------------|-------|---------|\n279\t\n280\t      | Qwen2.5-7B        | instruction | 0.55  |  +1.7   |\n281\t\n282\t      | Qwen2.5-14B (D012)| instruction | 0.53  |  +3.3   |\n283\t\n284\t      | Qwen2.5-14B (exp) | instruction | 0.41  |  +0.3   |\n285\t\n286\t      | Qwen2.5-72B-AWQ   | instruction | 0.32  |  +0.5   |\n287\t\n288\t      | Mistral-7B         | instruction | 0.35  |  -0.5   |\n289\t\n290\t      | LLaMA-8B           | instruction | 0.30  |  +1.0   |\n291\t\n292\t      | QwQ-32B            | reasoning   | 0.04  |   0.0   |\n293\t\n294\t      | DeepSeek-R1-8B     | reasoning   | 0.05  |   0.0   |\n295\t\n296\t      '\n297\t  figures_description:\n298\t  - 'F2_hero: C0 vs Gap scatter, 两个明显cluster（reasoning near origin, instruction scattered\n299\t    along C0=0.3-0.55 with gap≈0），无清晰正相关线'\n300\t  - 'F3_heatmap: model × domain C0 heatmap，颜色深浅对比清晰但gap column灰度几乎无变化'\n301\t  analysis: 'C0作为continuous predictor失败，仅作为binary indicator区分reasoning/instruction。\n302\t    对analysis paper：C0的价值从\"predict gain\"转为\"characterize model behavior\"—— 一个关于模型内部一致性的诊断工具，而非SICA部署决策工具。\n303\t\n304\t    '\n305\t- name: sica_72b_awq\n306\t  plan_id: exp-007\n307\t  description: Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct AWQ 4-bit on 60 questions\n308\t  expected_results:\n309\t    sica_accuracy: 0.783\n310\t    sc_accuracy: 0.783\n311\t    gap_pp: 0.0\n312\t    bootstrap_p: 0.5\n313\t    c0: 0.32\n314\t    c0_folio: 0.27\n315\t    c0_pw: 0.35\n316\t    sc_accuracy_folio: 0.833\n317\t    sc_accuracy_pw: 0.75\n318\t    maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.022\n319\t    wall_time_h: 3.8\n320\t  result_rationale: '72B模型更强→SC accuracy更高（78.3% vs 14B的70%），C0降到0.32（更confident→\n321\t    更少diversity）。Gap=0pp因为：(1) 高accuracy意味着SC已经选对了大部分题， 剩余错题是72B根本做不对的hard题；(2) C0=0.32虽然>20%但tiebreak题更少（约3个），\n322\t    样本太小无法产生可见gap；(3) 72B的constraint extraction质量虽然比7B/14B好， 但在它做错的题上constraints同样misleading。这个数据点支持\"stronger\n323\t    model → less room for SICA\"的叙事，但也支持worst tier的核心论点：即使在C0>20%的 optimal operating\n324\t    range内，SICA也不能reliably beat SC。\n325\t\n326\t    '\n327\t  tables:\n328\t  - name: scaling_72b_row\n329\t    content: '| Model | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap | p    | C0   |\n330\t\n331\t      |-------|--------|----------|-----|------|------|\n332\t\n333\t      | 7B    | 56.7%  |  58.3%   | 1.7 | 0.38 | 0.55 |\n334\t\n335\t      | 14B   | 70.0%  |  73.3%   | 3.3 | 0.23 | 0.53 |\n336\t\n337\t      | 72B   | 78.3%  |  78.3%   | 0.0 | 0.50 | 0.32 |\n338\t\n339\t      '\n340\t  figures_description:\n341\t  - 'Within-Qwen scaling curve: SC acc上升, C0下降, gap先升后降呈倒U但peak也不显著'\n342\t  analysis: '72B数据点完善了within-family scaling故事。对analysis paper：展示了一个 \"sweet spot\"幻觉——14B似乎是optimal，但扩展到大样本后14B的gap也消失。\n343\t    真正的故事是constraint extraction quality不随model size scaling。\n344\t\n345\t    '\n346\t- name: constraint_quality_case_studies\n347\t  plan_id: exp-008\n348\t  description: Qualitative analysis of 5-10 representative questions' extracted constraints\n349\t  expected_results:\n350\t    n_analyzed: 8\n351\t    semantically_meaningful_rate: 0.45\n352\t    shallow_pattern_rate: 0.35\n353\t    noise_rate: 0.2\n354\t    correct_exclusion_rate: 0.3\n355\t    false_exclusion_rate: 0.15\n356\t    missed_error_rate: 0.55\n357\t    finding: Constraints are predominantly surface-level pattern matches, not deep\n358\t      logical validators\n359\t  result_rationale: '定性分析揭示constraint extraction的根本问题：(1) ~45%的constraints语义上有意义 但过于浅层（如\"answer\n360\t    must be True or False\"）,不能区分正确/错误推理； (2) ~35%是shallow pattern matches（从推理trace中提取的句法模式而非逻辑约束）；\n361\t    (3) ~20%是纯噪声（extraction hallucination或parse error）。关键发现：在SICA 选错而SC选对的题上，constraints质量与选对的题无显著差异——说明MaxSAT不是在\n362\t    \"选择better constrained answer\"，而是在\"基于noisy signal做coin flip\"。 正确排除（exclusion导致正确答案翻转）仅30%，意味着大部分exclusion是neutral或harmful。\n363\t\n364\t    '\n365\t  tables: []\n366\t  figures_description:\n367\t  - 'Constraint quality taxonomy figure: 3层饼图 (meaningful/shallow/noise)'\n368\t  - 'Case study boxes: 2个SICA-correct + 2个SICA-wrong的constraint对比'\n369\t  analysis: '这是analysis paper最有叙事价值的实验之一。定性证据直接支撑\"why doesn''t it work\" 的故事：extraction\n370\t    bottleneck。LLM-based constraint extraction无法从free-form reasoning traces中提取足够faithful的逻辑约束。\n371\t\n372\t    '\n373\t- name: overhead_analysis\n374\t  plan_id: exp-009\n375\t  description: 'Wall-time breakdown per question: generation, extraction, MaxSAT'\n376\t  expected_results:\n377\t    avg_total_time_per_question_s: 45.2\n378\t    avg_generation_time_s: 38.5\n379\t    avg_extraction_time_s: 5.8\n380\t    avg_maxsat_time_s: 0.9\n381\t    generation_fraction: 0.852\n382\t    extraction_fraction: 0.128\n383\t    maxsat_fraction: 0.02\n384\t    overhead_vs_sc_percent: 17.4\n385\t    finding: SICA adds ~17% wall-time overhead over SC, dominated by extraction LLM\n386\t      calls\n387\t  result_rationale: 'Generation（vLLM inference）占~85%时间，这与SC相同。SICA的额外overhead来自 constraint\n388\t    extraction（~13%，每个trace一次extraction LLM call）和MaxSAT solving （~2%，Z3在小规模constraint\n389\t    sets上极快）。总overhead ~17%在worst tier下意味着 \"付出17%时间代价换来0pp gain\"——对analysis paper来说这是一个重要的负面数据点。\n390\t    但也说明overhead不是failure的原因（不是\"太贵所以不值\"而是\"even with acceptable cost it doesn''t help\"）。Extraction时间可优化（batch\n391\t    inference）但不改变 fundamental result。\n392\t\n393\t    '\n394\t  tables:\n395\t  - name: T4_overhead\n396\t    content: '| Phase       | Time(s) | Fraction | Notes                    |\n397\t\n398\t      |-------------|---------|----------|--------------------------|\n399\t\n400\t      | Generation  |  38.5   |  85.2%   | Same as SC               |\n401\t\n402\t      | Extraction  |   5.8   |  12.8%   | 1 LLM call per trace     |\n403\t\n404\t      | MaxSAT      |   0.9   |   2.0%   | Z3, <100 constraints     |\n405\t\n406\t      | **Total**   |  45.2   | 100.0%   | +17.4% vs SC baseline    |\n407\t\n408\t      '\n409\t  figures_description:\n410\t  - 'Stacked bar: generation(blue) >> extraction(orange) >> maxsat(red)'\n411\t  analysis: 'Overhead moderate但gain为零——cost-benefit明确为负。对analysis paper有价值： 排除\"overhead是barrier\"假说，聚焦在extraction\n412\t    quality而非computational cost。\n413\t\n414\t    '\n415\t- name: sica_mistral_7b\n416\t  plan_id: exp-010\n417\t  description: Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3 on D012 60 questions, cross-family validation\n418\t  expected_results:\n419\t    sica_accuracy: 0.55\n420\t    sc_accuracy: 0.567\n421\t    gap_pp: -1.7\n422\t    bootstrap_p: 0.65\n423\t    c0: 0.35\n424\t    c0_folio: 0.3\n425\t    c0_pw: 0.38\n426\t    sc_accuracy_folio: 0.633\n427\t    sc_accuracy_pw: 0.523\n428\t    sica_accuracy_folio: 0.6\n429\t    sica_accuracy_pw: 0.523\n430\t    maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.052\n431\t    constraint_parse_error_rate: 0.12\n432\t    wall_time_h: 1.3\n433\t  result_rationale: 'Mistral-7B是一个关键的cross-family数据点。C0=0.35（>20%，instruction model\n434\t    特征确认跨家族成立），但gap为负（-1.7pp）。原因：Mistral的reasoning trace风格与 Qwen不同——更短、更conversational、逻辑结构更隐式。基于Qwen\n435\t    trace风格tuned的 constraint extraction prompt在Mistral traces上效果更差（parse error rate\n436\t    12% vs Qwen的~3%），产生更多noisy constraints。MaxSAT在noisy constraints下做出 worse-than-random的selection（exclusion\n437\t    rate 5.2%但exclusion更多是false positive）。 FOLIO上SICA反而比SC低3.3pp：3道FOLIO题上SICA的constraint-based选择选错了。\n438\t    这是worst tier的smoking gun：SICA不仅不帮忙，在extraction quality差的情况下 actively harmful。\n439\t\n440\t    '\n441\t  tables:\n442\t  - name: mistral_row\n443\t    content: '| Model       | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap   | p    | C0   |\n444\t\n445\t      |-------------|--------|----------|-------|------|------|\n446\t\n447\t      | Mistral-7B  | 56.7%  |  55.0%   | -1.7  | 0.65 | 0.35 |\n448\t\n449\t      '\n450\t  figures_description:\n451\t  - 'Cross-family C0 comparison bar chart: Mistral C0与Qwen-7B同level，但gap方向相反'\n452\t  analysis: 'Worst tier关键证据：high C0 + negative gap。C0 pattern跨家族成立（instruction models都有high\n453\t    C0），但这不translate to SICA gains。Extraction quality是 family-specific的，没有universal\n454\t    effectiveness。对analysis paper：constraint extraction的family-specificity是一个重要failure\n455\t    mode。\n456\t\n457\t    '\n458\t- name: sica_llama_8b\n459\t  plan_id: exp-011\n460\t  description: LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct on D012 60 questions, third model family\n461\t  expected_results:\n462\t    sica_accuracy: 0.533\n463\t    sc_accuracy: 0.517\n464\t    gap_pp: 1.7\n465\t    bootstrap_p: 0.4\n466\t    c0: 0.3\n467\t    c0_folio: 0.27\n468\t    c0_pw: 0.32\n469\t    sc_accuracy_folio: 0.567\n470\t    sc_accuracy_pw: 0.485\n471\t    sica_accuracy_folio: 0.6\n472\t    sica_accuracy_pw: 0.485\n473\t    maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.038\n474\t    wall_time_h: 1.2\n475\t  result_rationale: 'LLaMA-8B的SC accuracy最低（51.7%），C0=0.30（instruction model，high\n476\t    diversity confirmed）。Gap=+1.7pp（p=0.40），方向正确但不显著。LLaMA的reasoning traces比 Mistral更structured（更接近Qwen风格），extraction\n477\t    quality中等，所以gap没有变负。 但在这么低的accuracy base上+1.7pp可能只是noise（1题的差异）。C0=0.30低于7B Qwen\n478\t    的0.55，可能因为LLaMA-8B在PW/FOLIO上部分题直接输出random答案而非structured reasoning，这些\"collapsed\"traces有相同的non-answer，被误计为low\n479\t    diversity。 三家族一起看：Qwen +1.7, Mistral -1.7, LLaMA +1.7，平均gap≈+0.6pp——实质为零。\n480\t\n481\t    '\n482\t  tables:\n483\t  - name: llama_row\n484\t    content: '| Model      | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap  | p    | C0   |\n485\t\n486\t      |------------|--------|----------|------|------|------|\n487\t\n488\t      | LLaMA-8B   | 51.7%  |  53.3%   | +1.7 | 0.40 | 0.30 |\n489\t\n490\t      '\n491\t  figures_description:\n492\t  - 'Three-family C0 bar chart: all >0.20, confirming cross-family pattern'\n493\t  analysis: '三家族validation完成：C0 pattern holds (all instruction models C0>20%)， 但SICA\n494\t    gain inconsistent across families (Qwen略正, Mistral负, LLaMA略正)。 对analysis paper：C0\n495\t    as diversity indicator validated; SICA as accuracy method invalidated。\n496\t\n497\t    '\n498\t- name: gsm8k_pilot_14b\n499\t  plan_id: exp-012\n500\t  description: Qwen2.5-14B on GSM8K 30-question pilot, cross-domain C0 test\n501\t  expected_results:\n502\t    sica_accuracy: 0.9\n503\t    sc_accuracy: 0.9\n504\t    gap_pp: 0.0\n505\t    c0: 0.1\n506\t    n_multi_candidate: 3\n507\t    sc_baseline_high: true\n508\t    constraint_extraction_issues: Numeric answer space makes constraint extraction\n509\t      trivial but useless\n510\t    wall_time_h: 0.8\n511\t  result_rationale: 'GSM8K对14B来说太简单（SC=90%），C0=10%远低于FOLIO/PW的38-42%。14B在GSM8K上 高度self-consistent因为这些是grade\n512\t    school math——模型confident且通常正确。 C0=10%中的3道multi-candidate题是calculation errors（不同traces算出不同数字），\n513\t    constraint extraction对numeric answers基本无意义（constraints变成\"answer=72\" vs \"answer=84\"这种trivial形式，MaxSAT退化为counting）。Gap=0pp。\n514\t    这个结果对analysis paper有双面价值：(1) 证明C0反映task-relative model confidence （14B在easy math上confident→low\n515\t    C0, 在logic reasoning上uncertain→high C0）； (2) 证明SICA在open-answer domain无additional\n516\t    failure mode，只是没value。\n517\t\n518\t    '\n519\t  tables:\n520\t  - name: gsm8k_row\n521\t    content: '| Dataset | Model | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap | C0   |\n522\t\n523\t      |---------|-------|--------|----------|-----|------|\n524\t\n525\t      | GSM8K   | 14B   | 90.0%  |  90.0%   | 0.0 | 0.10 |\n526\t\n527\t      | FOLIO   | 14B   | 74.0%  |  75.5%   | 1.5 | 0.38 |\n528\t\n529\t      | PW-D5   | 14B   | 71.3%  |  71.2%   |-0.1 | 0.42 |\n530\t\n531\t      '\n532\t  figures_description:\n533\t  - 'Cross-domain C0 comparison: GSM8K(low) vs FOLIO/PW(high)，支持task-relative confidence叙事'\n534\t  analysis: 'C0 as task-relative confidence indicator validated。14B在easy tasks上low\n535\t    C0， hard tasks上high C0。但这不help SICA''s accuracy case。对analysis paper： 丰富了C0的characterization\n536\t    story。\n537\t\n538\t    '\n539\t- name: constraint_ablation\n540\t  plan_id: exp-013\n541\t  description: SICA-MaxSAT vs SICA-count-only vs SICA-random-weight, CPU ablation\n542\t  expected_results:\n543\t    n_problems: 804\n544\t    maxsat_accuracy: 0.723\n545\t    count_only_accuracy: 0.722\n546\t    random_weight_accuracy: 0.718\n547\t    maxsat_vs_countonly_gap_pp: 0.1\n548\t    maxsat_vs_random_gap_pp: 0.5\n549\t    sc_accuracy: 0.72\n550\t    bootstrap_p_maxsat_vs_countonly: 0.48\n551\t    tiebreak_agreement_maxsat_countonly: 0.89\n552\t    finding: MaxSAT satisfiability checking adds no value over simple constraint counting\n553\t  result_rationale: '这是Claim 1的make-or-break实验。在worst tier下MaxSAT≈count-only（gap仅0.1pp,\n554\t    p=0.48）。原因：MaxSAT的附加价值来自satisfiability checking——检测constraints 之间的逻辑一致性，排除internally\n555\t    contradictory constraint sets。但实际extracted constraints几乎都是独立的（无cross-constraint\n556\t    logical dependencies），因为 extraction prompt从each trace independently提取，不产生inter-constraint\n557\t    implications。结果Z3的satisfiability solver对所有constraint sets都返回SAT （没有unsatisfiable\n558\t    subsets to detect），MaxSAT退化为weighted counting。 Tiebreak上MaxSAT和count-only的选择89%一致。Random-weight略差但差距也很小\n559\t    （0.5pp），说明constraint count本身与正确性的相关性非常微弱。\n560\t\n561\t    '\n562\t  tables:\n563\t  - name: constraint_ablation\n564\t    content: '| Method        | Accuracy | vs SC  | vs MaxSAT | p vs MaxSAT |\n565\t\n566\t      |---------------|----------|--------|-----------|-------------|\n567\t\n568\t      | SICA-MaxSAT   | 72.3%    | +0.3pp |    —      |      —      |\n569\t\n570\t      | SICA-CountOnly| 72.2%    | +0.2pp |  -0.1pp   |    0.48     |\n571\t\n572\t      | SICA-RandWt   | 71.8%    | -0.2pp |  -0.5pp   |    0.35     |\n573\t\n574\t      | SC baseline   | 72.0%    |   —    |  -0.3pp   |    0.42     |\n575\t\n576\t      '\n577\t  figures_description:\n578\t  - 'Ablation bar chart with error bars: 四种方法几乎等高'\n579\t  analysis: 'MaxSAT is over-engineering confirmed。但在analysis paper中这是一个有价值的 negative\n580\t    finding：formal satisfiability checking对LLM-extracted constraints 无附加价值，因为constraints缺乏inter-dependencies。Reframe为\"when\n581\t    does formal reasoning over constraints add value? When constraints have structure.\"\n582\t\n583\t    '\n584\t- name: sica_deepseek_r1_llama_8b\n585\t  plan_id: exp-014\n586\t  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-LLaMA-8B on 60 questions, second reasoning model\n587\t  expected_results:\n588\t    sica_accuracy: 0.633\n589\t    sc_accuracy: 0.633\n590\t    gap_pp: 0.0\n591\t    c0: 0.05\n592\t    c0_folio: 0.03\n593\t    c0_pw: 0.06\n594\t    sc_accuracy_folio: 0.7\n595\t    sc_accuracy_pw: 0.59\n596\t    temperature_invariance: true\n597\t    wall_time_h: 1.8\n598\t  result_rationale: 'DeepSeek-R1-Distill-LLaMA-8B是第二个reasoning model数据点。C0=5%（与QwQ-32B的\n599\t    3.6%相近），SICA≡SC。虽然这是8B的distilled版本（base是LLaMA而非Qwen），其 reasoning training使其表现出与QwQ-32B相同的self-consistency特征：extended\n600\t    thinking chain deterministically converges to single answer regardless of temperature\n601\t    sampling。C0=5%中的微量diversity来自PW（6%），可能是因为distillation 在logic domain上不如QwQ-32B彻底，少数题的reasoning\n602\t    chain有细微分歧。 关键确认：self-consistency是reasoning training的产物而非architecture/family 的产物（LLaMA\n603\t    base instruction model C0=30%, 同LLaMA base reasoning model C0=5%）。\n604\t\n605\t    '\n606\t  tables:\n607\t  - name: reasoning_models_combined\n608\t    content: '| Model              | Base   | Type      | C0   | Gap  |\n609\t\n610\t      |--------------------|--------|-----------|------|------|\n611\t\n612\t      | QwQ-32B            | Qwen   | reasoning | 3.6% | 0.0  |\n613\t\n614\t      | DeepSeek-R1-8B     | LLaMA  | reasoning | 5.0% | 0.0  |\n615\t\n616\t      | LLaMA-3.1-8B-Inst | LLaMA  | instruct  | 30%  | +1.7 |\n617\t\n618\t      '\n619\t  figures_description:\n620\t  - 'Same-base comparison: LLaMA-8B-Instruct(C0=30%) vs DeepSeek-R1-LLaMA-8B(C0=5%)——same\n621\t    architecture, reasoning training eliminates diversity'\n622\t  analysis: 对analysis paper的核心贡献之一：reasoning training fundamentally changes output\n623\t    diversity characteristics。Same LLaMA-8B base, instruction版C0=30%, reasoning版C0=5%。这是关于reasoning\n624\t    model internals的novel finding： reasoning training doesn't just improve accuracy,\n625\t    it collapses the output distribution. Frame为understanding WHY reasoning models\n626\t    are self-consistent.\n627\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cebba36c-c90c-46b8-b6db-cdce7b24e5e2","uuid":"15142561-60a2-44b8-a533-cabfb660e7ef","timestamp":"2026-05-16T13:18:05.932Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T124139/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'D023 triggered. All 3 original accuracy claims abandoned. Paper\n  pivots to \"Why Doesn''t Symbolic Consensus Improve LLM Reasoning? A Diagnostic Study.\"\n  Contributions restructured: (1) C0 as zero-cost diversity indicator across model\n  families — characterizes WHEN models disagree, not IF symbolic methods help; (2)\n  Negative result on constraint-based aggregation — identifies failure modes (extraction\n  noise, shallow constraints); (3) Taxonomy of reasoning vs instruction model behavior\n  under sampling. Target EMNLP Findings (50-60%), AAAI 2027 fallback.\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: sica_expanded_14b\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: PW D5 600 + FOLIO 204 = 804 questions, K=12, T=0.7, Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n  expected_results:\n    n_total: 804\n    n_folio: 204\n    n_pw: 600\n    sica_accuracy_combined: 0.723\n    sc_accuracy_combined: 0.72\n    combined_gap_pp: 0.3\n    bootstrap_p_combined: 0.42\n    sica_accuracy_folio: 0.755\n    sc_accuracy_folio: 0.74\n    folio_gap_pp: 1.5\n    bootstrap_p_folio: 0.28\n    sica_accuracy_pw: 0.712\n    sc_accuracy_pw: 0.713\n    pw_gap_pp: -0.1\n    bootstrap_p_pw: 0.55\n    c0_folio: 0.38\n    c0_pw: 0.42\n    c0_combined: 0.41\n    maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.031\n    tiebreak_count_folio: 18\n    tiebreak_count_pw: 55\n    tiebreak_sica_win_rate: 0.55\n    wall_time_h: 13.5\n  result_rationale: 'D012的60题FOLIO +6.7pp是小样本方差膨胀的产物。扩展到204题后，FOLIO的gain从+6.7pp 回归到+1.5pp（p=0.28），因为D012中SICA赢的那几道tiebreak题恰好是高信息量的，但在\n    更大样本中tiebreak题的比例被稀释、且新增题中constraint extraction质量参差不齐—— 约30%的FOLIO新增题涉及复杂嵌套量词，extraction产生shallow/错误constraints，MaxSAT\n    解与count-only等价。PW在600题规模上SICA与SC几乎完全一致（-0.1pp），因为PW的逻辑 结构虽然更formal，但14B在PW D5上的SC已经接近ceiling（~71%），剩余错题多为模型\n    根本理解不了的推理链，constraint extraction无法挽救。Combined gap仅+0.3pp， bootstrap p=0.42，远未达到显著性。核心问题：constraint\n    extraction的噪声在大样本 中不再被幸运tiebreak掩盖。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: T1_main_results_expanded\n    content: '| Dataset    |   N | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap (pp) | p-value |  C0  |\n\n      |------------|-----|--------|----------|----------|---------|------|\n\n      | FOLIO      | 204 | 74.0%  |  75.5%   |   +1.5   |  0.28   | 0.38 |\n\n      | PW-D5      | 600 | 71.3%  |  71.2%   |   -0.1   |  0.55   | 0.42 |\n\n      | Combined   | 804 | 72.0%  |  72.3%   |   +0.3   |  0.42   | 0.41 |\n\n      | D012 (ref) |  60 | 70.0%  |  73.3%   |   +3.3   |  0.23   | 0.53 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: D012 vs Expanded FOLIO gap收缩可视化，误差条重叠'\n  - 'Per-question delta histogram: 大多数delta=0，少数±1，分布近似对称'\n  analysis: 'D023 trigger确认。FOLIO gap ≤+2pp且p>0.20，combined gap ≈0。论文必须pivot。 但C0=0.38-0.42的数据仍然有价值——证明14B\n    instruction model在这些任务上确实产生 trace diversity，只是symbolic aggregation无法有效利用这些diversity。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_k_ablation_14b\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: K sensitivity (K=6,8,12,16,20) on D012's 60 questions\n  expected_results:\n    k6_sica_acc: 0.717\n    k6_sc_acc: 0.7\n    k6_gap_pp: 1.7\n    k6_c0: 0.45\n    k6_tiebreak_count: 8\n    k8_sica_acc: 0.717\n    k8_sc_acc: 0.7\n    k8_gap_pp: 1.7\n    k8_c0: 0.48\n    k8_tiebreak_count: 6\n    k12_sica_acc: 0.733\n    k12_sc_acc: 0.7\n    k12_gap_pp: 3.3\n    k12_c0: 0.53\n    k12_tiebreak_count: 5\n    k16_sica_acc: 0.717\n    k16_sc_acc: 0.717\n    k16_gap_pp: 0.0\n    k16_c0: 0.52\n    k16_tiebreak_count: 3\n    k20_sica_acc: 0.717\n    k20_sc_acc: 0.717\n    k20_gap_pp: 0.0\n    k20_c0: 0.5\n    k20_tiebreak_count: 2\n    wall_time_h: 4.8\n  result_rationale: 'K=12时的+3.3pp是D012原始结果的复现，但这个gain几乎完全来自tiebreak场景。 K=6/8（奇数tiebreak不可能或更少）时gap降到+1.7pp，因为偶数K下tie更频繁但\n    SICA在tie上的win rate仅~55%，所以净gain不稳定。K=16/20时tie几乎消失（majority 更decisive），gap归零。这揭示了一个致命模式：SICA的gain完全依赖于tiebreak频率，\n    而非对非tie题的改进。K增大→tie减少→gain消失，说明SICA不是在做更好的推理聚合， 只是在coin-flip场景中略好于random。C0随K略有变化但基本稳定在0.45-0.53，说明\n    trace diversity是模型固有属性而非K的函数——这一点对analysis paper有价值。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: T3_k_sensitivity\n    content: '|  K  | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap | C0   | #Ties | Tie Win% |\n\n      |-----|--------|----------|-----|------|-------|----------|\n\n      |  6  | 70.0%  |  71.7%   | 1.7 | 0.45 |   8   |  56.3%   |\n\n      |  8  | 70.0%  |  71.7%   | 1.7 | 0.48 |   6   |  55.0%   |\n\n      | 12  | 70.0%  |  73.3%   | 3.3 | 0.53 |   5   |  60.0%   |\n\n      | 16  | 71.7%  |  71.7%   | 0.0 | 0.52 |   3   |  50.0%   |\n\n      | 20  | 71.7%  |  71.7%   | 0.0 | 0.50 |   2   |  50.0%   |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F4_k_curve: Gap vs K折线图，显示gap在K>12后趋零'\n  - 'Tiebreak frequency vs K: 明显下降曲线'\n  analysis: 'Worst tier下K ablation暴露SICA的核心弱点：gain完全是tiebreak artifact。 对analysis\n    paper有价值：说明constraint-based方法在非tie场景无法改变SC的选择， 因为extraction noise使constraint分布与answer正确性无相关性。\n\n    '\n- name: tiebreak_baseline_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: SICA vs SC-random vs SC-deterministic tiebreak comparison, CPU reanalysis\n  expected_results:\n    n_tiebreak_problems_d012: 5\n    sica_tiebreak_win_rate: 0.6\n    sc_random_tiebreak_expected_win_rate: 0.5\n    sc_alphabetical_win_rate: 0.6\n    sc_first_seen_win_rate: 0.4\n    n_tiebreak_problems_expanded: 73\n    sica_tiebreak_win_rate_expanded: 0.534\n    sc_random_expected_expanded: 0.5\n    bootstrap_p_sica_vs_random_expanded: 0.31\n    sica_minus_random_gap_on_ties_pp: 3.4\n    overall_sica_vs_sc_random_gap_pp: 0.1\n  result_rationale: 'D012上5个tiebreak题SICA赢4个（80%）是小样本幸运。扩展到exp-001的73个tiebreak题后，\n    SICA的tiebreak win rate回归到53.4%——仅比random的50%高3.4pp，bootstrap p=0.31， 不显著。核心原因：constraint\n    extraction在tiebreak题上的质量与非tiebreak题无差异， 而tiebreak题本身是模型\"真不确定\"的题，extracted constraints同样嘈杂、浅层，\n    MaxSAT无法从噪声中提取信号。SICA略高于random可能只是因为MaxSAT倾向于选择 constraint数更多的answer，而这与正确性有微弱正相关（正确reasoning\n    chain产生 略多parseable constraints）。但这个效应太弱，无法在统计上与random区分。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: T2_tiebreak_comparison\n    content: '| Tiebreak Method    | D012 (5 ties) | Expanded (73 ties) | p vs random\n      |\n\n      |--------------------|---------------|--------------------|-------------|\n\n      | SICA (MaxSAT)      |   80.0%       |     53.4%          |    0.31     |\n\n      | SC-random          |   50.0%       |     50.0% (E)      |     —       |\n\n      | SC-alphabetical    |   60.0%       |     49.3%          |    0.48     |\n\n      | SC-first-seen      |   40.0%       |     50.7%          |    0.47     |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Tiebreak win rate bar chart with 95% CI whiskers: 所有方法的CI严重重叠'\n  analysis: 'Worst tier核心证据之一。SICA的tiebreak优势在大样本中消失，与random不可区分。 对analysis paper的contribution：证明constraint\n    extraction的质量不足以在 真正ambiguous的题上提供信号——constraints是shallow syntactic patterns，\n    不capture deep reasoning validity。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_7b_scaling\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on 60 questions, within-Qwen scaling\n  expected_results:\n    sica_accuracy: 0.583\n    sc_accuracy: 0.567\n    gap_pp: 1.7\n    bootstrap_p: 0.38\n    c0: 0.55\n    c0_folio: 0.5\n    c0_pw: 0.58\n    sc_accuracy_folio: 0.6\n    sc_accuracy_pw: 0.545\n    sica_accuracy_folio: 0.633\n    sica_accuracy_pw: 0.545\n    maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.045\n    constraint_quality_score: 0.42\n    wall_time_h: 1.8\n  result_rationale: '7B模型更弱→C0更高（0.55 vs 14B的0.53），符合\"weaker model = more diversity\"假设。\n    但SICA gain仅+1.7pp（p=0.38），不显著。原因：虽然7B产生更多diversity（更多tie和 multi-candidate问题），但7B的constraint\n    extraction质量更差——7B生成的reasoning traces更短、逻辑结构更松散，LLM-based extraction从这些traces中提取的constraints\n    更浅层、更多噪声。高C0+低extraction quality=SICA无法利用diversity。这是worst tier 的核心失败模式：C0确实预测diversity，但diversity≠SICA\n    can help，因为中间的 constraint extraction是bottleneck。FOLIO上有微弱+3.3pp是因为FOLIO答案空间 只有3类（True/False/Unknown），即使noisy\n    constraints也能偶尔选对。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: scaling_7b_row\n    content: '| Model | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap | p    | C0   |\n\n      |-------|--------|----------|-----|------|------|\n\n      | 7B    | 56.7%  |  58.3%   | 1.7 | 0.38 | 0.55 |\n\n      | 14B   | 70.0%  |  73.3%   | 3.3 | 0.23 | 0.53 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - C0 vs model size scatter点 (7B, 14B)：C0随size略降，但gap并非随C0线性增\n  analysis: 'C0高但gap不显著——直接反驳\"C0 predicts SICA gain\"的简单叙事。 对analysis paper：C0 predicts\n    diversity (✓) 但不 predict gain (✗)， 因为constraint extraction quality是hidden confounder。\n\n    '\n- name: qwq_32b_operating_regime\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: QwQ-32B existing data formatted for operating regime analysis\n  expected_results:\n    c0_aime: 0.0\n    c0_pw: 0.188\n    c0_folio: 0.0\n    c0_combined: 0.036\n    sica_sc_gap_pp: 0.0\n    n_total: 48\n    finding: Reasoning model structurally self-consistent across all domains and temperatures\n    temperature_effect: Zero diversity at T=0.7, 0.9, 1.0\n  result_rationale: '这是已有数据的重新整理，不产生新结果。QwQ-32B的C0=3.6%已经确认reasoning model 的structural\n    self-consistency。在worst tier下这个数据点的价值反而增强——它是 analysis paper的核心finding之一：reasoning\n    models (QwQ, DeepSeek-R1) 的 extended thinking chain使输出高度确定性，温度采样无法打破这个determinism。\n    这不是SICA的失败，而是reasoning model internals的特性。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: qwq_operating_regime\n    content: '| Domain | N  | C0    | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap |\n\n      |--------|----|-------|--------|----------|-----|\n\n      | AIME   | 22 | 0.0%  | 72.7%  |  72.7%   | 0.0 |\n\n      | PW     | 16 | 18.8% | ~69%   |  ~69%    | 0.0 |\n\n      | FOLIO  | 10 | 0.0%  |  —     |   —      | 0.0 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'C0 heatmap row for QwQ-32B: 几乎全白（near-zero diversity across domains）'\n  analysis: '对analysis paper是正面贡献：reasoning model的self-consistency是一个有发表价值的 empirical\n    finding。Frame为\"reasoning models represent a fundamentally different operating\n    regime where symbolic consensus is structurally redundant\"。\n\n    '\n- name: c0_diagnostic_validation\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: C0 vs SICA-SC gap scatter across all models and K values, CPU analysis\n  expected_results:\n    n_datapoints: 12\n    pearson_r_c0_vs_gap: 0.31\n    pearson_p: 0.33\n    spearman_rho: 0.27\n    binary_threshold_accuracy: 0.75\n    c0_threshold_used: 0.2\n    high_c0_avg_gap: 0.8\n    low_c0_avg_gap: 0.0\n    high_c0_points: 8\n    low_c0_points: 4\n  result_rationale: '在worst tier下，C0与gap的连续相关性很弱（r=0.31, p=0.33），因为高C0的数据点 （7B/14B/Mistral/LLaMA\n    instruction models）虽然都有C0>20%，但gap分布在 [-1pp, +2pp]之间，无清晰趋势。二值分类（C0>20% → potential\n    gain vs C0<20% → no gain）准确率75%，但这主要是因为low-C0点（QwQ, DeepSeek-R1）gap全为0， 而不是因为high-C0点gap都>0。实质上C0只能区分\"reasoning\n    vs instruction\"， 不能在instruction model内部预测gain大小。这使得Claim 3从\"continuous predictor\"\n    弱化为\"binary family classifier\"——而这基本等于直接看模型是否是reasoning model， C0作为diagnostic的增量价值存疑。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: c0_diagnostic_summary\n    content: '| Model              | Type        | C0    | Gap(pp) |\n\n      |--------------------|-------------|-------|---------|\n\n      | Qwen2.5-7B        | instruction | 0.55  |  +1.7   |\n\n      | Qwen2.5-14B (D012)| instruction | 0.53  |  +3.3   |\n\n      | Qwen2.5-14B (exp) | instruction | 0.41  |  +0.3   |\n\n      | Qwen2.5-72B-AWQ   | instruction | 0.32  |  +0.5   |\n\n      | Mistral-7B         | instruction | 0.35  |  -0.5   |\n\n      | LLaMA-8B           | instruction | 0.30  |  +1.0   |\n\n      | QwQ-32B            | reasoning   | 0.04  |   0.0   |\n\n      | DeepSeek-R1-8B     | reasoning   | 0.05  |   0.0   |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F2_hero: C0 vs Gap scatter, 两个明显cluster（reasoning near origin, instruction scattered\n    along C0=0.3-0.55 with gap≈0），无清晰正相关线'\n  - 'F3_heatmap: model × domain C0 heatmap，颜色深浅对比清晰但gap column灰度几乎无变化'\n  analysis: 'C0作为continuous predictor失败，仅作为binary indicator区分reasoning/instruction。\n    对analysis paper：C0的价值从\"predict gain\"转为\"characterize model behavior\"—— 一个关于模型内部一致性的诊断工具，而非SICA部署决策工具。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_72b_awq\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct AWQ 4-bit on 60 questions\n  expected_results:\n    sica_accuracy: 0.783\n    sc_accuracy: 0.783\n    gap_pp: 0.0\n    bootstrap_p: 0.5\n    c0: 0.32\n    c0_folio: 0.27\n    c0_pw: 0.35\n    sc_accuracy_folio: 0.833\n    sc_accuracy_pw: 0.75\n    maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.022\n    wall_time_h: 3.8\n  result_rationale: '72B模型更强→SC accuracy更高（78.3% vs 14B的70%），C0降到0.32（更confident→\n    更少diversity）。Gap=0pp因为：(1) 高accuracy意味着SC已经选对了大部分题， 剩余错题是72B根本做不对的hard题；(2) C0=0.32虽然>20%但tiebreak题更少（约3个），\n    样本太小无法产生可见gap；(3) 72B的constraint extraction质量虽然比7B/14B好， 但在它做错的题上constraints同样misleading。这个数据点支持\"stronger\n    model → less room for SICA\"的叙事，但也支持worst tier的核心论点：即使在C0>20%的 optimal operating\n    range内，SICA也不能reliably beat SC。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: scaling_72b_row\n    content: '| Model | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap | p    | C0   |\n\n      |-------|--------|----------|-----|------|------|\n\n      | 7B    | 56.7%  |  58.3%   | 1.7 | 0.38 | 0.55 |\n\n      | 14B   | 70.0%  |  73.3%   | 3.3 | 0.23 | 0.53 |\n\n      | 72B   | 78.3%  |  78.3%   | 0.0 | 0.50 | 0.32 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Within-Qwen scaling curve: SC acc上升, C0下降, gap先升后降呈倒U但peak也不显著'\n  analysis: '72B数据点完善了within-family scaling故事。对analysis paper：展示了一个 \"sweet spot\"幻觉——14B似乎是optimal，但扩展到大样本后14B的gap也消失。\n    真正的故事是constraint extraction quality不随model size scaling。\n\n    '\n- name: constraint_quality_case_studies\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: Qualitative analysis of 5-10 representative questions' extracted constraints\n  expected_results:\n    n_analyzed: 8\n    semantically_meaningful_rate: 0.45\n    shallow_pattern_rate: 0.35\n    noise_rate: 0.2\n    correct_exclusion_rate: 0.3\n    false_exclusion_rate: 0.15\n    missed_error_rate: 0.55\n    finding: Constraints are predominantly surface-level pattern matches, not deep\n      logical validators\n  result_rationale: '定性分析揭示constraint extraction的根本问题：(1) ~45%的constraints语义上有意义 但过于浅层（如\"answer\n    must be True or False\"）,不能区分正确/错误推理； (2) ~35%是shallow pattern matches（从推理trace中提取的句法模式而非逻辑约束）；\n    (3) ~20%是纯噪声（extraction hallucination或parse error）。关键发现：在SICA 选错而SC选对的题上，constraints质量与选对的题无显著差异——说明MaxSAT不是在\n    \"选择better constrained answer\"，而是在\"基于noisy signal做coin flip\"。 正确排除（exclusion导致正确答案翻转）仅30%，意味着大部分exclusion是neutral或harmful。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Constraint quality taxonomy figure: 3层饼图 (meaningful/shallow/noise)'\n  - 'Case study boxes: 2个SICA-correct + 2个SICA-wrong的constraint对比'\n  analysis: '这是analysis paper最有叙事价值的实验之一。定性证据直接支撑\"why doesn''t it work\" 的故事：extraction\n    bottleneck。LLM-based constraint extraction无法从free-form reasoning traces中提取足够faithful的逻辑约束。\n\n    '\n- name: overhead_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: 'Wall-time breakdown per question: generation, extraction, MaxSAT'\n  expected_results:\n    avg_total_time_per_question_s: 45.2\n    avg_generation_time_s: 38.5\n    avg_extraction_time_s: 5.8\n    avg_maxsat_time_s: 0.9\n    generation_fraction: 0.852\n    extraction_fraction: 0.128\n    maxsat_fraction: 0.02\n    overhead_vs_sc_percent: 17.4\n    finding: SICA adds ~17% wall-time overhead over SC, dominated by extraction LLM\n      calls\n  result_rationale: 'Generation（vLLM inference）占~85%时间，这与SC相同。SICA的额外overhead来自 constraint\n    extraction（~13%，每个trace一次extraction LLM call）和MaxSAT solving （~2%，Z3在小规模constraint\n    sets上极快）。总overhead ~17%在worst tier下意味着 \"付出17%时间代价换来0pp gain\"——对analysis paper来说这是一个重要的负面数据点。\n    但也说明overhead不是failure的原因（不是\"太贵所以不值\"而是\"even with acceptable cost it doesn''t help\"）。Extraction时间可优化（batch\n    inference）但不改变 fundamental result。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: T4_overhead\n    content: '| Phase       | Time(s) | Fraction | Notes                    |\n\n      |-------------|---------|----------|--------------------------|\n\n      | Generation  |  38.5   |  85.2%   | Same as SC               |\n\n      | Extraction  |   5.8   |  12.8%   | 1 LLM call per trace     |\n\n      | MaxSAT      |   0.9   |   2.0%   | Z3, <100 constraints     |\n\n      | **Total**   |  45.2   | 100.0%   | +17.4% vs SC baseline    |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Stacked bar: generation(blue) >> extraction(orange) >> maxsat(red)'\n  analysis: 'Overhead moderate但gain为零——cost-benefit明确为负。对analysis paper有价值： 排除\"overhead是barrier\"假说，聚焦在extraction\n    quality而非computational cost。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_mistral_7b\n  plan_id: exp-010\n  description: Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3 on D012 60 questions, cross-family validation\n  expected_results:\n    sica_accuracy: 0.55\n    sc_accuracy: 0.567\n    gap_pp: -1.7\n    bootstrap_p: 0.65\n    c0: 0.35\n    c0_folio: 0.3\n    c0_pw: 0.38\n    sc_accuracy_folio: 0.633\n    sc_accuracy_pw: 0.523\n    sica_accuracy_folio: 0.6\n    sica_accuracy_pw: 0.523\n    maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.052\n    constraint_parse_error_rate: 0.12\n    wall_time_h: 1.3\n  result_rationale: 'Mistral-7B是一个关键的cross-family数据点。C0=0.35（>20%，instruction model\n    特征确认跨家族成立），但gap为负（-1.7pp）。原因：Mistral的reasoning trace风格与 Qwen不同——更短、更conversational、逻辑结构更隐式。基于Qwen\n    trace风格tuned的 constraint extraction prompt在Mistral traces上效果更差（parse error rate\n    12% vs Qwen的~3%），产生更多noisy constraints。MaxSAT在noisy constraints下做出 worse-than-random的selection（exclusion\n    rate 5.2%但exclusion更多是false positive）。 FOLIO上SICA反而比SC低3.3pp：3道FOLIO题上SICA的constraint-based选择选错了。\n    这是worst tier的smoking gun：SICA不仅不帮忙，在extraction quality差的情况下 actively harmful。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: mistral_row\n    content: '| Model       | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap   | p    | C0   |\n\n      |-------------|--------|----------|-------|------|------|\n\n      | Mistral-7B  | 56.7%  |  55.0%   | -1.7  | 0.65 | 0.35 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cross-family C0 comparison bar chart: Mistral C0与Qwen-7B同level，但gap方向相反'\n  analysis: 'Worst tier关键证据：high C0 + negative gap。C0 pattern跨家族成立（instruction models都有high\n    C0），但这不translate to SICA gains。Extraction quality是 family-specific的，没有universal\n    effectiveness。对analysis paper：constraint extraction的family-specificity是一个重要failure\n    mode。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_llama_8b\n  plan_id: exp-011\n  description: LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct on D012 60 questions, third model family\n  expected_results:\n    sica_accuracy: 0.533\n    sc_accuracy: 0.517\n    gap_pp: 1.7\n    bootstrap_p: 0.4\n    c0: 0.3\n    c0_folio: 0.27\n    c0_pw: 0.32\n    sc_accuracy_folio: 0.567\n    sc_accuracy_pw: 0.485\n    sica_accuracy_folio: 0.6\n    sica_accuracy_pw: 0.485\n    maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.038\n    wall_time_h: 1.2\n  result_rationale: 'LLaMA-8B的SC accuracy最低（51.7%），C0=0.30（instruction model，high\n    diversity confirmed）。Gap=+1.7pp（p=0.40），方向正确但不显著。LLaMA的reasoning traces比 Mistral更structured（更接近Qwen风格），extraction\n    quality中等，所以gap没有变负。 但在这么低的accuracy base上+1.7pp可能只是noise（1题的差异）。C0=0.30低于7B Qwen\n    的0.55，可能因为LLaMA-8B在PW/FOLIO上部分题直接输出random答案而非structured reasoning，这些\"collapsed\"traces有相同的non-answer，被误计为low\n    diversity。 三家族一起看：Qwen +1.7, Mistral -1.7, LLaMA +1.7，平均gap≈+0.6pp——实质为零。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: llama_row\n    content: '| Model      | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap  | p    | C0   |\n\n      |------------|--------|----------|------|------|------|\n\n      | LLaMA-8B   | 51.7%  |  53.3%   | +1.7 | 0.40 | 0.30 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Three-family C0 bar chart: all >0.20, confirming cross-family pattern'\n  analysis: '三家族validation完成：C0 pattern holds (all instruction models C0>20%)， 但SICA\n    gain inconsistent across families (Qwen略正, Mistral负, LLaMA略正)。 对analysis paper：C0\n    as diversity indicator validated; SICA as accuracy method invalidated。\n\n    '\n- name: gsm8k_pilot_14b\n  plan_id: exp-012\n  description: Qwen2.5-14B on GSM8K 30-question pilot, cross-domain C0 test\n  expected_results:\n    sica_accuracy: 0.9\n    sc_accuracy: 0.9\n    gap_pp: 0.0\n    c0: 0.1\n    n_multi_candidate: 3\n    sc_baseline_high: true\n    constraint_extraction_issues: Numeric answer space makes constraint extraction\n      trivial but useless\n    wall_time_h: 0.8\n  result_rationale: 'GSM8K对14B来说太简单（SC=90%），C0=10%远低于FOLIO/PW的38-42%。14B在GSM8K上 高度self-consistent因为这些是grade\n    school math——模型confident且通常正确。 C0=10%中的3道multi-candidate题是calculation errors（不同traces算出不同数字），\n    constraint extraction对numeric answers基本无意义（constraints变成\"answer=72\" vs \"answer=84\"这种trivial形式，MaxSAT退化为counting）。Gap=0pp。\n    这个结果对analysis paper有双面价值：(1) 证明C0反映task-relative model confidence （14B在easy math上confident→low\n    C0, 在logic reasoning上uncertain→high C0）； (2) 证明SICA在open-answer domain无additional\n    failure mode，只是没value。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: gsm8k_row\n    content: '| Dataset | Model | SC Acc | SICA Acc | Gap | C0   |\n\n      |---------|-------|--------|----------|-----|------|\n\n      | GSM8K   | 14B   | 90.0%  |  90.0%   | 0.0 | 0.10 |\n\n      | FOLIO   | 14B   | 74.0%  |  75.5%   | 1.5 | 0.38 |\n\n      | PW-D5   | 14B   | 71.3%  |  71.2%   |-0.1 | 0.42 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cross-domain C0 comparison: GSM8K(low) vs FOLIO/PW(high)，支持task-relative confidence叙事'\n  analysis: 'C0 as task-relative confidence indicator validated。14B在easy tasks上low\n    C0， hard tasks上high C0。但这不help SICA''s accuracy case。对analysis paper： 丰富了C0的characterization\n    story。\n\n    '\n- name: constraint_ablation\n  plan_id: exp-013\n  description: SICA-MaxSAT vs SICA-count-only vs SICA-random-weight, CPU ablation\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 804\n    maxsat_accuracy: 0.723\n    count_only_accuracy: 0.722\n    random_weight_accuracy: 0.718\n    maxsat_vs_countonly_gap_pp: 0.1\n    maxsat_vs_random_gap_pp: 0.5\n    sc_accuracy: 0.72\n    bootstrap_p_maxsat_vs_countonly: 0.48\n    tiebreak_agreement_maxsat_countonly: 0.89\n    finding: MaxSAT satisfiability checking adds no value over simple constraint counting\n  result_rationale: '这是Claim 1的make-or-break实验。在worst tier下MaxSAT≈count-only（gap仅0.1pp,\n    p=0.48）。原因：MaxSAT的附加价值来自satisfiability checking——检测constraints 之间的逻辑一致性，排除internally\n    contradictory constraint sets。但实际extracted constraints几乎都是独立的（无cross-constraint\n    logical dependencies），因为 extraction prompt从each trace independently提取，不产生inter-constraint\n    implications。结果Z3的satisfiability solver对所有constraint sets都返回SAT （没有unsatisfiable\n    subsets to detect），MaxSAT退化为weighted counting。 Tiebreak上MaxSAT和count-only的选择89%一致。Random-weight略差但差距也很小\n    （0.5pp），说明constraint count本身与正确性的相关性非常微弱。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: constraint_ablation\n    content: '| Method        | Accuracy | vs SC  | vs MaxSAT | p vs MaxSAT |\n\n      |---------------|----------|--------|-----------|-------------|\n\n      | SICA-MaxSAT   | 72.3%    | +0.3pp |    —      |      —      |\n\n      | SICA-CountOnly| 72.2%    | +0.2pp |  -0.1pp   |    0.48     |\n\n      | SICA-RandWt   | 71.8%    | -0.2pp |  -0.5pp   |    0.35     |\n\n      | SC baseline   | 72.0%    |   —    |  -0.3pp   |    0.42     |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Ablation bar chart with error bars: 四种方法几乎等高'\n  analysis: 'MaxSAT is over-engineering confirmed。但在analysis paper中这是一个有价值的 negative\n    finding：formal satisfiability checking对LLM-extracted constraints 无附加价值，因为constraints缺乏inter-dependencies。Reframe为\"when\n    does formal reasoning over constraints add value? When constraints have structure.\"\n\n    '\n- name: sica_deepseek_r1_llama_8b\n  plan_id: exp-014\n  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-LLaMA-8B on 60 questions, second reasoning model\n  expected_results:\n    sica_accuracy: 0.633\n    sc_accuracy: 0.633\n    gap_pp: 0.0\n    c0: 0.05\n    c0_folio: 0.03\n    c0_pw: 0.06\n    sc_accuracy_folio: 0.7\n    sc_accuracy_pw: 0.59\n    temperature_invariance: true\n    wall_time_h: 1.8\n  result_rationale: 'DeepSeek-R1-Distill-LLaMA-8B是第二个reasoning model数据点。C0=5%（与QwQ-32B的\n    3.6%相近），SICA≡SC。虽然这是8B的distilled版本（base是LLaMA而非Qwen），其 reasoning training使其表现出与QwQ-32B相同的self-consistency特征：extended\n    thinking chain deterministically converges to single answer regardless of temperature\n    sampling。C0=5%中的微量diversity来自PW（6%），可能是因为distillation 在logic domain上不如QwQ-32B彻底，少数题的reasoning\n    chain有细微分歧。 关键确认：self-consistency是reasoning training的产物而非architecture/family 的产物（LLaMA\n    base instruction model C0=30%, 同LLaMA base reasoning model C0=5%）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: reasoning_models_combined\n    content: '| Model              | Base   | Type      | C0   | Gap  |\n\n      |--------------------|--------|-----------|------|------|\n\n      | QwQ-32B            | Qwen   | reasoning | 3.6% | 0.0  |\n\n      | DeepSeek-R1-8B     | LLaMA  | reasoning | 5.0% | 0.0  |\n\n      | LLaMA-3.1-8B-Inst | LLaMA  | instruct  | 30%  | +1.7 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Same-base comparison: LLaMA-8B-Instruct(C0=30%) vs DeepSeek-R1-LLaMA-8B(C0=5%)——same\n    architecture, reasoning training eliminates diversity'\n  analysis: 对analysis paper的核心贡献之一：reasoning training fundamentally changes output\n    diversity characteristics。Same LLaMA-8B base, instruction版C0=30%, reasoning版C0=5%。这是关于reasoning\n    model internals的novel finding： reasoning training doesn't just improve accuracy,\n    it collapses the output distribution. Frame为understanding WHY reasoning models\n    are self-consistent.\n","numLines":627,"startLine":1,"totalLines":627}}}
